","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"어떤 일을 해결하는 데 가장 중요한 것.","englishExpression":"key; core; pivot","englishDescription":"The most important thing to solve a problem.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=22029&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:25961:1","headword":"주요하다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"중심이 되고 중요하다.","englishExpression":"major; key","englishDescription":"Central and important.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25961&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:26888:1","headword":"열쇠","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"잠금 장치를 잠그거나 열 수 있게 하는 도구.","englishExpression":"key","englishDescription":"A device for locking or opening a lock.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26888&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:26888:2","headword":"열쇠","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"(비유적으로) 어떠한 문제나 사건을 해결하는 데 도움을 주는 중요한 정보나 사물.","englishExpression":"key; clue","englishDescription":"(figurative) An important piece of information or an object that helps resolve a case or problem.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26888&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:32498:3","headword":"기둥","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"(비유적으로) 집안이나 단체, 나라에서 의지가 될 만한 중요한 사람이나 중심이 되는 것.","englishExpression":"pillar; prop; key","englishDescription":"(figurative) In a family, group, or country, an important person or central thing that can be relied on.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=32498&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:42202:1","headword":"단서","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"문제를 해결하는 데 도움이 되는 사실.","englishExpression":"clue; key; lead","englishDescription":"A fact that helps resolve a problem.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=42202&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:68903:1","headword":"요체","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"중요한 점.","englishExpression":"key; main point","englishDescription":"An important point.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=68903&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:69508:2","headword":"숨골","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"(비유적으로) 사물이나 대상의 가장 중요한 부분.","englishExpression":"core; key","englishDescription":"(figurative) The most important part of a thing or object.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69508&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:71472:5","headword":"카드","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"어떤 일을 해결하기 위해 사용하는 결정적인 방법이나 수단.","englishExpression":"solution; key","englishDescription":"A critical method or means used to solve a certain issue.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71472&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:75238:1","headword":"조","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"음을 정리하고 질서 있게 하는 가장 기본이 되는 조직.","englishExpression":"key; tonality","englishDescription":"A system that serves as a basis for arranging notes in an orderly fashion.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75238&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:81793:1","headword":"키","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"문이나 자물쇠를 잠그거나 여는 도구.","englishExpression":"key","englishDescription":"An implement that is used to lock or unlock a door or lock.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81793&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:81793:4","headword":"키","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"피아노나 풍금과 같은 건반 악기에서, 손가락으로 눌러 소리를 내는 부분.","englishExpression":"key","englishDescription":"The part of a keyboard instrument such as a piano or harmonium, that makes sounds when pressed with fingers.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81793&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:84935:1","headword":"핵","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"어떤 것의 가장 중심이 되는 것.","englishExpression":"key; core; center; heart","englishDescription":"The very center of something.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84935&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:84939:1","headword":"핵심","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"가장 중심이 되거나 중요한 부분.","englishExpression":"key; core; center","englishDescription":"The central or most important part of something.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84939&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:84940:1","headword":"핵심적","partOfSpeech":"determiner","partOfSpeechKo":"관형사","definitionKo":"가장 중심이 되거나 중요한.","englishExpression":"central; key; main","englishDescription":"Being the central or most important part of something.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84940&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"mmm":[{"id":"krdict:26153:2","headword":"어","partOfSpeech":"interjection","partOfSpeechKo":"감탄사","definitionKo":"기쁨이나 감동의 느낌을 나타낼 때 내는 소리.","englishExpression":"ah; mmm; ooh","englishDescription":"An exclamation uttered when the speaker expresses his/her delight or excitement.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26153&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:67539:5","headword":"에","partOfSpeech":"interjection","partOfSpeechKo":"감탄사","definitionKo":"무엇을 생각하거나 기억이 잘 나지 않을 때 내는 소리.","englishExpression":"hm; mmm","englishDescription":"An exclamation uttered when the speaker thinks of something or cannot remember something.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67539&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:71111:2","headword":"음","partOfSpeech":"interjection","partOfSpeechKo":"감탄사","definitionKo":"마음에 들지 않거나 걱정스러울 때 하는 소리.","englishExpression":"hm; mmm","englishDescription":"An exclamation uttered when the speaker does not like something or feels anxious about it.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71111&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:87472:1","headword":"흠","partOfSpeech":"adverb","partOfSpeechKo":"부사","definitionKo":"냄새를 맡으려고 콧숨을 들이쉬는 소리. 또는 그 모양.","englishExpression":"mmm","englishDescription":"A word imitating the sound or describing the motion of breathing through the nose to smell something.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87472&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:87473:1","headword":"흠","partOfSpeech":"interjection","partOfSpeechKo":"감탄사","definitionKo":"흐뭇하거나 기분이 좋을 때 입을 다물고 코로 쉬는 숨을 내쉬며 내는 소리.","englishExpression":"hm; mmm","englishDescription":"A sound made when you are happy or in a good mood, with your mouth closed and exhaling through your nose.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87473&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"reparation":[{"id":"krdict:59141:1","headword":"배상","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"남에게 입힌 손해를 물어 주는 일.","englishExpression":"compensation; reparation","englishDescription":"The act of paying for the damage that one caused to another person.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=59141&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"salvage":[{"id":"krdict:73057:1","headword":"인양","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"높은 곳으로 끌어 옮김.","englishExpression":"salvage","englishDescription":"An act of lifting something to a higher place.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73057&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:73059:1","headword":"인양하다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"높은 곳으로 끌어 옮기다.","englishExpression":"pull up; refloat; salvage","englishDescription":"To lift something to a higher place.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73059&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"squared":[{"id":"krdict:41457:1","headword":"네모나다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"네모 모양으로 되어 있다.","englishExpression":"squared; quadrilateral","englishDescription":"It is square in shape.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=41457&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"threesome":[{"id":"krdict:61145:1","headword":"삼총사","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"(비유적으로) 어울려 다니면서 친하게 지내는 세 사람.","englishExpression":"trio; threesome; triumvirate; three musketeers","englishDescription":"(figurative) A group of three people who are on close terms and hang around together.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61145&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"wee-wee":[{"id":"krdict:65194:1","headword":"쉬","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"(어린아이의 말로) 오줌을 눔. 또는 오줌.","englishExpression":"pee; wee-wee","englishDescription":"(children&apos;s term) Urinating, or urine.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65194&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"whoa":[{"id":"krdict:17872:3","headword":"와","partOfSpeech":"interjection","partOfSpeechKo":"감탄사","definitionKo":"소나 말을 멈추게 하거나 가만히 있으라고 달래는 소리.","englishExpression":"whoa","englishDescription":"An exclamation uttered to soothe and stop a cow or horse.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17872&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:67103:1","headword":"어이구","partOfSpeech":"interjection","partOfSpeechKo":"감탄사","definitionKo":"매우 아프거나 힘들거나 놀라거나 기막힐 때 내는 소리.","englishExpression":"oh; whoa; aah","englishDescription":"An exclamation uttered when the speaker is aching, exhausted, surprised, or stunned.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67103&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:67105:1","headword":"어이구머니","partOfSpeech":"interjection","partOfSpeechKo":"감탄사","definitionKo":"매우 심하게 아프거나 힘들거나 놀라거나 기막힐 때 내는 소리.","englishExpression":"oh; whoa; aah","englishDescription":"An exclamation uttered when the speaker is very severely aching, exhausted, surprised, or stunned.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67105&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:67114:1","headword":"어이쿠","partOfSpeech":"interjection","partOfSpeechKo":"감탄사","definitionKo":"매우 아프거나 힘들거나 분하거나 기막힐 때 내는 소리.","englishExpression":"oh; whoa; aah","englishDescription":"An exclamation uttered when the speaker is aching, exhausted, vexed, or stunned.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67114&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:87454:2","headword":"우우","partOfSpeech":"interjection","partOfSpeechKo":"감탄사","definitionKo":"짐승을 몰거나 뒤쫓을 때 내는 소리.","englishExpression":"whoa","englishDescription":"An exclamation uttered when driving or hunting for animals.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87454&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:91716:3","headword":"우아","partOfSpeech":"interjection","partOfSpeechKo":"감탄사","definitionKo":"소나 말을 멈추게 하거나 가만히 있으라고 달래는 소리.","englishExpression":"whoa","englishDescription":"An exclamation uttered to soothe and stop a cow or horse.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91716&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"zeal":[{"id":"krdict:14088:3","headword":"열기","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"어떤 일을 하고자 하는 욕망.","englishExpression":"zeal; enthusiasm; eagerness","englishDescription":"The desire to do something.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14088&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:24094:1","headword":"의욕","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"무엇을 하고자 하는 적극적인 마음이나 의지.","englishExpression":"volition; zeal; enthusiasm","englishDescription":"One's positive mind or will to do something.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24094&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:58399:1","headword":"백열","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"무엇을 하려는 마음이나 열정이 최고 상태에 달함. 또는 최고 상태에 달한 마음이나 열정.","englishExpression":"zeal; ardency","englishDescription":"A state in which one's will or passion to do something reaches its peak, or such will or passion.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58399&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:67472:1","headword":"열성","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"매우 깊고 뜨거운 정성.","englishExpression":"zeal; fervor; enthusiasm","englishDescription":"Very sincere and passionate earnestness.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67472&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:67581:1","headword":"열의","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"어떤 일을 이루어 내려는 강한 의지.","englishExpression":"enthusiasm; zeal","englishDescription":"The strong will to achieve something.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67581&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}]}}
